# libkernel — additions the SDK's libkernel.so stub does not carry.
#
# SONAME libkernel.sprx, so the converter maps these onto the real libkernel
# module exactly like the SDK stub's own symbols.
#
# sceKernelIsTrinityMode (NID tU5e3f9gSiU): is this title running in PS5 Pro
# ("Trinity") mode. It is a plain libkernel export: Sony's game-side
# libScePsml (PSSR) imports it from the SAME library slot as sceKernelUsleep.
# EVO cannot reach it any other way - sceKernelDlsym fails for every name from
# an app module, even sceKernelUsleep (hw-proven 2026-09-26).
# See docs/hardware/psml-research.md.
#
# One symbol only: a name the firmware's libkernel does not export makes the
# loader reject the whole module (CE-108255-1, no log). If a build with this
# line does not launch, this line is why - remove it.
sceKernelIsTrinityMode
